@startuml
title Passport Automation System - Sequence Diagram

actor Applicant
participant "Passport Management System" as PMS
participant "Enquiry Officer" as Officer
database "Passport Database" as DB

Applicant -> PMS : Submit applicant details
PMS -> Applicant : Request supporting proofs
Applicant -> PMS : Submit proofs
PMS -> DB : Store applicant details and proofs
DB --> PMS : Confirm storage
PMS -> Officer : Request verification
Officer -> PMS : Return verification result

alt Details and proofs are valid
    PMS -> DB : Update status to Approved
    DB --> PMS : Confirm approval
    PMS -> Applicant : Notify passport issuance
else Details or proofs are invalid
    PMS -> Applicant : Request correction or reject application
end

@enduml
